        "confidence": 0.95
      },
      {
        "text": "District attorneys and police officers should take crime seriously.",
        "confidence": 0.95
      },
      {
        "text": "Many individuals fail to consider the practical consequences of their beliefs on real-world communities.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "Property and violent crime are unacceptable to citizens and small business owners.",
