    "turn_idx": 26,
    "turn_text": "I want to talk to you to talk a little more about your, your, your pack. I think it's MA for Dems supporting some of the, the more interest or more vulnerable house Democrats running for reelection in the Northeast. You got Congressman Joe Courtney, Congressman Jared Golden, Congresswoman Annie Custer and the New Hampshire and the Second District of New Hampshire and Congressman Chris Pappas also in New Hampshire. Why these four members? What are you going to be doing to help help some of your Democratic colleagues get reelected?",
