    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/4/9/49220.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 35,
    "turn_text": "He's a veteran and I largely share his politics and I think he can win. And I take this race somewhat personally to be blunt because, you know, Mike Garcia is a member of the four country caucus. This is a guy who served in the armed forces who claims to put country above party and blatant put party above country. I mean, it's very rare that an amorphous slogan like that actually gets put to the test in a crystallized fashion. And January 6th was that test. And it's just stunning to me to see somebody's principles be so 180 degrees removed from their actions. And it needs to be punished at the ballot box.",
